{"data":{"title":"Dear Moleskine","slug":"dear-moleskine","path":"/artists/jay-electronica/tracks/dear-moleskine/","artwork":null,"artist":{"id":"qEepsOmH1us","slug":"jay-electronica","links":null,"title":"Jay Electronica","artwork":null},"id":"yh3RcwpVyVc"},"appearanceCount":2,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"G9kwFfcIky8","show":{"id":"jTSehXE5AIc","slug":"169","title":"Soulection Radio Show #169","artwork":"/images/episodes/169.jpg","content":"Plenty of new music stacked ready to share with you.\n<!--more-->\n\nIt felt good to be back after being away from the studio for 4 weeks. We've been traveling for the past month spreading The Sound of Tomorrow at SXSW, WMC, and now Asia. The pros of being away for so long meant that Joe stacked up on plenty of music for the past month which makes up for the lost time, trust. There is too much to say and talk about but shout out to all of the amazing people who came out to our shows to see and connect with us. We are very grateful!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","published_at":"2014-04-05T01:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"rBTjD90b6NE","show":{"id":"gXo3AqS_FMA","slug":"339","title":"Soulection Radio Show #339 (Live from Melbourne, Australia)","artwork":"/images/episodes/339.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-12-09T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":56336,"platform":"lastfm","href":"https://www.last.fm/music/Jay+Electronica/_/Dear+Moleskine","artwork":"https://lastfm-img2.akamaized.net/i/u/300x300/0322743c5d9a4450be268e9b40513a79.png","last_checked_at":"2018-05-15T14:37:20+00:00","track":"yh3RcwpVyVc"},{"id":56357,"platform":"bandcamp","href":"https://humblethepoet.bandcamp.com/track/dear-moleskine-humble-the-poet-noyz-jay-electronica-revisit","artwork":"https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a1199654482_16.jpg","last_checked_at":"2020-04-13T16:04:27.76+00:00","track":"yh3RcwpVyVc"},{"id":56351,"platform":"soundcloud","href":"https://soundcl